# ── Personal contact exports (PII) ───────────────────────────────────
# Untracked deliberately: these are real address-book dumps containing
# names and contact details. They remain in git history — purging them
# requires a coordinated `git filter-repo` rewrite plus a force-push.
# See PRODUCTION_READINESS_ASSESSMENT.md (P3-3) / implementation_plan.md (WI-18).
abook-*_contacts.json
thunderbird_addressbooks.json

